{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>喜茶出可以飲嘅「生打椰拉麵」</h2>\n<p>內地喜茶與日清合味道聯手推出話題新品「生打椰拉麵」。它把經典杯麵的視覺與儀式感搬進手搖飲品：椰子冰沙做「湯底」，芒果布丁條扮「拉麵」，再配以芒果粒、馬蹄丸子和甜粟米，整杯像極了一碗迷你杯麵，卻是貨真價實的甜品飲品。\n</p>\n<h2>生打椰子冰沙＋芒果布甸條</h2>\n<p>「生打椰拉麵」以細緻椰子沙冰為基底，融合芒果果肉與馬蹄丸子，帶來濃郁椰香與果香。頂層則附上獨立小料碗，「芒果拉麵」，再撒上甜脆水果粟米粒，視覺上完全復刻日式拉麵的模樣。「拉麵」其實是切成細長條狀的芒果布甸，並非真正麵條。整杯飲品從頂部的滑溜拉麵、甜脆粟米，到底部的椰香冰沙與雙重咬口配料，口感層次豐富，甜而不膩。</p>\n<h2>4步食法</h2>\n<p>官方更在杯蓋上印上4步飲用貼士，令這杯「可以飲的拉麵」充滿玩味。首先揭開頂層紙蓋，取出獨立小料碗；接着將芒果拉麵凍與粟米粒倒入杯中；然後用附送的小叉子叉起拉麵凍，蘸取底部椰子冰沙一同品嚐；最後也可直接插入吸管拌勻飲用。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490963693483745_8423180286afc25c5d7c53.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490963693483745_8423180286afc25c5d7c53.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490964014813292_13993662586afc25c8becbd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490964014813292_13993662586afc25c8becbd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490964238249881_6932056036afc25caf116d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490964238249881_6932056036afc25caf116d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490964466172982_9578709426afc25cd0f72d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490964466172982_9578709426afc25cd0f72d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df1c5qQE1KB/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:12:06.266641+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":514,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T10:00:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:25:46.739751+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:05:31.355678+00:00","content_hash":"1da5dee2ae4577649685aea6a25e0e0741c36bed200efda11f7bc135684296cf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}